Ratios H(k)/H(k-1):
  H(2)/H(1) = 5.000000
  H(3)/H(2) = 5.800000
  H(4)/H(3) = 8.034483
  H(5)/H(4) = 10.682403
  H(6)/H(5) = 13.568903
  H(7)/H(6) = 16.660794
