  H(9)/H(8) = 23.413639
  H(10)/H(9) = 27.062301
  H(11)/H(10) = 30.884445
  H(12)/H(11) = 34.874781

Key theorem: ep_end(2k-2, T_k) = H(k-1) [PROVED]
Anti-palindrome: ep_start(v, T_k) = ep_end(2k-1-v, T_k) [PROVED]
Consequence: ep_start(0)=a_k, ep_start(1)=H(k-1), ep_start(2k-2)=ep_start(2k-1)=a_{k-1}
